Jakob Creutzig wrote:
> Getsome writes:
>
> > I got a samarai and am trying to figure out how to #twoweapon
> > every time I try I end up wielding my pickax or I am left empty handed
> > how do I do it?
>
> Nethack has a "wielded weapon" and an "alternate weapon" slot.  So,
>
> 1) Wield weapon #1.
> 2) Type 'x' for moving #1 to "alternate" slot.
> 3) Wield weapon #2.
> 4) Type #twoweapon.

Note that when you #twoweapon the artifact has to be the one
in the primary slot not the alternate slot.  Use "x" again to put
it there.  Also in vanilla it doesn't work with two artifacts.  They
refuse to play second fiddle even to better artifacts.

And something that doesn't apply to samurai - Not all classes
are able to #twoweapon.



